<!-- Afertettu launcher glyph: a moth at rest, wings folded into a triangle,
     plumed antennae, a spot on each wing. One even-odd path, so the spots
     are holes that show the background, and the same drawable works as the
     themed icon mask. Scaled to 74% so the wing tips stay inside the 66 dp
     safe zone.
     No fixed paint: the glyph colour is a dynamic palette resource, see
     res/values/colors.xml. As the monochrome layer the system replaces the
     tint anyway, so both the plain and the themed icon follow the wallpaper. -->
